          <p class="text-center text-orange-200/70 mb-16 text-lg">Pon a prueba tu conocimiento de Dragon Ball</p>
          <div class="space-y-8">
            <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-orange-900/40 to-black border border-orange-500/30">
              <h4 class="font-bold text-orange-300 text-lg mb-4">1. ¿Cuántas esferas del dragón existen?</h4>
              <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                <button class="quiz-btn px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-black/50 border border-orange-500/30 text-orange-200 hover:bg-orange-500/20 transition text-left" data-correct="true">A) 7 esferas</button>
                <button class="quiz-btn px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-black/50 border border-orange-500/30 text-orange-200 hover:bg-orange-500/20 transition text-left">B) 5 esferas</button>
                <button class="quiz-btn px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-black/50 border border-orange-500/30 text-orange-200 hover:bg-orange-500/20 transition text-left">C) 10 esferas</button>
                <button class="quiz-btn px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-black/50 border border-orange-500/30 text-orange-200 hover:bg-orange-500/20 transition text-left">D) 3 esferas</button>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-900/40 to-black border border-blue-500/30">
              <h4 class="font-bold text-blue-300 text-lg mb-4">2. ¿Quién es el príncipe de los Saiyans?</h4>
              <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                <button class="quiz-btn px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-black/50 border border-blue-500/30 text-blue-200 hover:bg-blue-500/20 transition text-left">A) Goku</button>
                <button class="quiz-btn px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-black/50 border border-blue-500/30 text-blue-200 hover:bg-blue-500/20 transition text-left">B) Gohan</button>
                <button class="quiz-btn px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-black/50 border border-blue-500/30 text-blue-200 hover:bg-blue-500/20 transition text-left" data-correct="true">C) Vegeta</button>
                <button class="quiz-btn px-4 py-3 rounded-xl bg-black/50 border border-blue-500/30 text-blue-200 hover:bg-blue-500/20 transition text-left">D) Piccolo</button>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-yellow-900/40 to-black border border-yellow-500/30">
              <h4 class="font-bold text-yellow-300 text-lg mb-4">3. ¿Cómo se llama la técnica más icónica de Goku?</h4>
              <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-3">
